      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Most views also read Status.State to show messages and report view-owned errors; those arrows are omitted.\nCommands reach every service API through its Access protocol.\nCommand-only services have no State and are never observed by views.",
